{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2019-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1550188800, "end_date": 1550793599, "month_true_total": 550, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:09:37 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49146046", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136644131", "personaname": "Jesus is Lord", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136644131/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 3564, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1628, "last_played": 1705984717, "avatar": "69cd884f3798dda32e0827c8c6505e5f6d7a7c2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Haven't played a lot but what i can tell you is it looks amazing, plays great. The best military simulation game I've ever played. I like the realistic factor. Makes me feel like I'm in the military. Just throw on some vr goggles on and go on a 360° treadmill and you're all set haha.", "timestamp_created": 1550791020, "timestamp_updated": 1550791020, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49143323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057230687", "personaname": "Ritz | GFuel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ritz123/", "num_games_owned": 225, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 45854, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 35779, "last_played": 1777915566, "avatar": "bf75679257e466f5c39f5e0e8ca79c945a40a64f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Training for WW3 in progress... Will let you know how well it turns out...", "timestamp_created": 1550777493, "timestamp_updated": 1550777493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49142059", "author": {"steamid": "76561198873813075", "personaname": "wedinisaiah", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198873813075/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3549, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3324, "last_played": 1551217514, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Definitely  worth it if you like Realistic military Games. There people on every once and awhile that ruin the experience but 99% of the community is great. There is lots of different servers for many different play styles. as well as campaign. And scenario creators. And even if you don't have the DLC's that a server has you can still play just cant use the DLC weps or vehicles", "timestamp_created": 1550771847, "timestamp_updated": 1550771847, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49141602", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970621876", "personaname": "Xyster", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xystro/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 51365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13907, "last_played": 1770791428, "avatar": "f464da1e6fa1616f554edc1220fed40edec265ab"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still, after all these years, ARMA is one of the best team-play experiences I have had online. \nVery much would recommend this game to anyone looking for a sim that will incourage communication and cooperation.\n\nThis is a bit different than what some might consider to be an FPS. I'm not saying it is better. It is different.\nIf you get it, run the training sims and learn the ropes. \n\nNice graphics. Decent performance. Wide-open maps. Huge arsenal. \nIt is or was pretty heavy on the system. With a good rig, it hasn't given me many issues, besides the occasional spike from massive destruction.", "timestamp_created": 1550770047, "timestamp_updated": 1550770047, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49140755", "author": {"steamid": "76561198322068323", "personaname": "HKG3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198322068323/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 15172, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4869, "last_played": 1779563351, "avatar": "2228e7a2eafe1f0ba8fd9dbdb91c4c221b4f91cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "hell yeah brother", "timestamp_created": 1550766924, "timestamp_updated": 1550766924, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}